  "releaseNotes": "v5.0.0: Major release with backtesting support and cross-platform native libraries. New BacktestingClientBuilder enables running strategies against historical data with identical code to live trading. Includes playback control (pause/resume/seek), disk/memory caching, and file-based offline backtesting. Linux and macOS native libraries now included in NuGet package.",
